1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,567
<i> Matias, what's the news?</i>

2
00:00:01,733 --> 00:00:02,867
<i>What if he refuses to do
what you're asking?</i>

3
00:00:03,267 --> 00:00:05,000
<i> He's here at Delgado's house.</i>

4
00:00:05,133 --> 00:00:06,700
<i>The person he needs
to take out is not here.</i>

5
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:08,633
<i>He knows better
than to cross us.</i>

6
00:00:08,767 --> 00:00:10,933
<i>So don't waste your time on him.</i>

7
00:00:11,067 --> 00:00:13,167
<i>- Is that clear?
- Yes, Boss.</i>

8
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,767
<i>This is payment for the sins
I committed against you.</i>

9
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,200
<i> What are you talking about?</i>

10
00:00:17,333 --> 00:00:20,200
<i>I did everything
to protect your husband.</i>

11
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:21,333
<i>There's nothing we can do, Joey.</i>

12
00:00:21,467 --> 00:00:23,467
<i>The flash drive
really can't be restored.</i>

13
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,800
<i>Why do you suddenly
need my help?</i>

14
00:00:25,933 --> 00:00:28,167
<i>The flash drive couldn't be
restored.</i>

15
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,067
<i> I need to talk to Golda</i>

16
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,700
<i> so I can make her admit</i>

17
00:00:31,833 --> 00:00:33,400
<i>that what they're saying about
her and Dad isn't true.</i>

18
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:35,267
<i> I know where Golda lives.</i>

19
00:00:35,433 --> 00:00:36,267
<i>It's late.
Where is Joey?</i>

20
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,300
<i>She's gone, she left
a while ago.</i>

21
00:00:38,433 --> 00:00:40,767
<i>Looks like she left in a hurry.</i>

22
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:42,333
<i>Why does it feel like
she's not coming back?</i>

23
00:00:42,467 --> 00:00:43,533
<i> Whose is this?</i>

24
00:00:43,667 --> 00:00:45,933
<i> Let's just come back tomorrow.</i>

25
00:00:46,067 --> 00:00:48,400
<i>Looks like someone's here.
Golda might already be inside.</i>

26
00:00:48,533 --> 00:00:49,500
<i> Hello, Parak?</i>

27
00:00:49,633 --> 00:00:51,033
<i> Abort the operation.</i>

28
00:00:51,167 --> 00:00:53,433
<i>Our services for Berdugo
are terminated.</i>

29
00:00:53,567 --> 00:00:57,967
<i>I know now why Parak can't seem
to eliminate Delgado.</i>

30
00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:59,133
<i> They're friends.</i>

31
00:00:59,267 --> 00:01:01,433
<i> Parak's happy days are over.</i>

32
00:01:01,567 --> 00:01:03,267
<i>This is the reason I wanted you
to come here...</i>

33
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:05,667
<i>so he can explain
the truth to you himself.</i>

34
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:06,733
<i> I recognize this.</i>

35
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:08,900
<i>This is exactly
what that man used.</i>

36
00:01:09,033 --> 00:01:10,600
<i>Your Godfather Diego
betrayed us.</i>

37
00:01:10,733 --> 00:01:12,200
<i>What you're saying
is impossible.</i>

38
00:01:12,333 --> 00:01:13,967
<i> That is not true.</i>

39
00:01:39,633 --> 00:01:40,533
Joey, it doesn't seem like

40
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:42,700
anyone's here at your
Godfather Diego's house.

41
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,333
We'll find out.

42
00:01:45,467 --> 00:01:47,700
Okay, are you sure...

43
00:01:47,833 --> 00:01:50,267
you want to do this?

44
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:53,067
Joey, this could be dangerous.

45
00:01:55,367 --> 00:01:57,867
I just want to set dad free.

46
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:58,867
He doesn't deserve
to be in prison

47
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,000
just because of them.

48
00:02:01,133 --> 00:02:02,033
You just need to record
everything

49
00:02:02,167 --> 00:02:04,067
that will happen inside.

50
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:12,533
You really didn't tell
Ma'am Clarissa

51
00:02:12,667 --> 00:02:15,400
about your arraignment today,
Major?

52
00:02:15,567 --> 00:02:16,433
No.

53
00:02:16,567 --> 00:02:18,733
I don't want her
and Joey to worry.

54
00:02:18,867 --> 00:02:21,500
I hope Ma'am understands.

55
00:02:21,633 --> 00:02:24,567
The attorney said
I can post bail.

56
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:26,567
I'll be home later.

57
00:02:28,900 --> 00:02:30,267
I understand.

58
00:02:31,467 --> 00:02:32,867
Attorney.

59
00:02:34,467 --> 00:02:35,467
The judge isn't here yet.

60
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:36,933
He will be late.

61
00:02:38,067 --> 00:02:39,300
That's fine.

62
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:45,433
May I use the restroom first?

63
00:02:45,567 --> 00:02:48,767
Attorney, I'll just go to
the restroom.

64
00:03:31,233 --> 00:03:33,733
Joey...

65
00:03:33,867 --> 00:03:35,300
You're leaving?

66
00:03:37,033 --> 00:03:38,967
I was hoping to.

67
00:03:39,100 --> 00:03:40,400
I'm in a hurry too.

68
00:03:40,533 --> 00:03:42,733
Sorry if you need
to leave as well.

69
00:03:42,867 --> 00:03:45,033
- So...
- Wait.

70
00:03:45,167 --> 00:03:47,067
I want to know the truth.

71
00:03:48,833 --> 00:03:49,833
- Really?
- Was my video really

72
00:03:49,967 --> 00:03:52,233
not recovered from
the flash drive?

73
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:10,700
I trusted you, Godfather!

74
00:04:10,833 --> 00:04:12,067
Because I thought you were
a good person!

75
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,933
I thought you would help Dad!

76
00:04:14,067 --> 00:04:15,100
But you're the reason...

77
00:04:15,233 --> 00:04:17,700
he went to jail!

78
00:04:17,833 --> 00:04:20,700
How could you do this to us?

79
00:04:20,833 --> 00:04:22,600
You're heartless!

80
00:04:22,733 --> 00:04:25,433
We know everything.

81
00:04:25,567 --> 00:04:29,100
So if I were you,
I'd confess...

82
00:04:29,267 --> 00:04:30,833
Parak.

83
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,000
The order to us...

84
00:04:42,133 --> 00:04:43,567
is to eliminate Diego.

85
00:04:43,700 --> 00:04:44,867
Surround the house...

86
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,800
so he can't escape.

87
00:04:48,767 --> 00:04:50,433
Joey, I'm sorry,

88
00:04:50,567 --> 00:04:53,400
but you really need to leave

89
00:04:53,533 --> 00:04:54,567
before they find out...

90
00:04:54,700 --> 00:04:57,533
I disobeyed their orders!

91
00:04:57,667 --> 00:05:00,133
Orders? What orders?

92
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:03,067
Who ordered you?

93
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:05,300
Why don't you just admit it,
Godfather?

94
00:05:05,433 --> 00:05:06,633
Did you betray my family?

95
00:05:06,767 --> 00:05:09,500
Did you betray Dad?

96
00:05:09,633 --> 00:05:11,667
How could you do this to us?

97
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,400
I trusted you,

98
00:05:14,533 --> 00:05:17,233
but it turns out
you're the reason!

99
00:05:17,367 --> 00:05:18,733
Godfather, we treated you
like family!

100
00:05:18,867 --> 00:05:21,000
How could you do this to us?

101
00:05:29,467 --> 00:05:31,067
Why won't you answer me?

102
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:33,667
How could you do this to us?
I trusted you!

103
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:36,700
We treated you like family,
and you did this to dad!

104
00:05:38,367 --> 00:05:40,667
Answer me, Godfather!

105
00:05:41,733 --> 00:05:43,233
Be quiet for a moment, Joey.

106
00:05:43,367 --> 00:05:44,700
They're here.

107
00:05:47,933 --> 00:05:50,167
They're coming in.

108
00:05:56,133 --> 00:05:57,667
Hello?

109
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,333
Hello?

110
00:06:01,467 --> 00:06:02,633
Wait, I can't hear you.

111
00:06:02,767 --> 00:06:04,067
Hello?

112
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:08,000
Hello?

113
00:06:08,967 --> 00:06:10,433
Hello?

114
00:06:52,633 --> 00:06:54,133
Major?

115
00:06:58,500 --> 00:06:59,867
Major!

116
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,800
Cruz, help!

117
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:06,233
Cruz!

118
00:07:06,367 --> 00:07:08,200
Hey! Hey!

119
00:07:09,100 --> 00:07:10,200
Stop!

120
00:07:10,333 --> 00:07:11,833
Delgado, are you okay?

121
00:07:15,267 --> 00:07:17,433
Base, a suspect is escaping
from the courtroom.

122
00:07:17,567 --> 00:07:19,767
I need backup.
I repeat, I need backup!

123
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:21,167
Over!

124
00:07:23,867 --> 00:07:25,633
What do we do?
We might get trapped here.

125
00:07:25,767 --> 00:07:27,167
You need to hide here for now.

126
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:28,633
Hide?
We don't need to hide.

127
00:07:28,767 --> 00:07:29,700
Let's escape.

128
00:07:29,833 --> 00:07:31,367
They can't see you

129
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:33,333
because even if you escape,

130
00:07:33,467 --> 00:07:34,733
they'll hunt you down.

131
00:07:34,867 --> 00:07:35,967
You don't know these people.

132
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:38,067
And you do?

133
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:41,800
They're a syndicate,
and they want you dead.

134
00:07:41,933 --> 00:07:43,300
Godfather, you can't get hurt.

135
00:07:43,433 --> 00:07:45,100
You're the only one
who can help Dad.

136
00:07:45,233 --> 00:07:47,700
I have to face them, Joey.

137
00:07:47,867 --> 00:07:50,100
I'm coming with you.

138
00:07:50,233 --> 00:07:52,233
You can't.
It's dangerous.

139
00:07:52,367 --> 00:07:54,433
What if you run away
from us again?

140
00:07:54,567 --> 00:07:56,600
That's what you were
about to do earlier, right?

141
00:08:00,700 --> 00:08:02,100
You know how to handle a gun?

142
00:08:09,633 --> 00:08:12,067
Joey, hide here for now.

143
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,200
No matter what happens,

144
00:08:13,333 --> 00:08:16,067
don't make a sound.

145
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:19,833
Joey, if something goes wrong,
call me.

146
00:08:19,967 --> 00:08:21,867
Okay. Be careful.

147
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:34,800
What's your plan?

148
00:08:34,933 --> 00:08:37,300
We can't just keep
hiding from them.

149
00:08:38,567 --> 00:08:39,500
It's simple.

150
00:08:39,633 --> 00:08:40,700
There are only four of them.

151
00:08:40,833 --> 00:08:44,133
Once we neutralize them,
that's when we escape.

152
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,367
Looks like they caught on to us.

153
00:09:10,333 --> 00:09:12,167
Parak, come out!

154
00:09:12,300 --> 00:09:14,067
Don't make this hard for us!

155
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,967
You can't escape,

156
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:17,700
so show yourself!

157
00:09:18,933 --> 00:09:20,767
You don't want to, huh?

158
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:31,600
Search the rooms.

159
00:09:31,733 --> 00:09:33,100
I'll stay here.

160
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,067
Boss, I think they're here!

161
00:10:52,867 --> 00:10:54,467
- Come here!
- Don't!

162
00:10:58,233 --> 00:11:00,300
Where is Parak?
Talk!

163
00:11:04,533 --> 00:11:05,967
Hey, lower your gun!

164
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:27,200
Up! Get up!

165
00:11:27,333 --> 00:11:28,800
You too!

166
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:55,400
Joey!

167
00:12:55,533 --> 00:12:56,600
Where is Parak?

168
00:12:56,733 --> 00:12:58,400
You're making this hard for me.

169
00:13:05,733 --> 00:13:06,933
Idiot!

170
00:13:07,067 --> 00:13:10,000
He was already handcuffed and
you still couldn't kill him!

171
00:13:10,133 --> 00:13:12,400
Make sure no one
can identify you,

172
00:13:12,533 --> 00:13:13,500
because if they do,

173
00:13:13,633 --> 00:13:15,767
I'll personally finish you off!

174
00:13:18,900 --> 00:13:20,967
So? Are you done with Parak?

175
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:23,200
<i>He's slippery, Boss.
We even lost some men.</i>

176
00:13:23,367 --> 00:13:25,133
Damn it!

177
00:13:25,267 --> 00:13:26,767
Miguel already slipped
through my fingers,

178
00:13:26,900 --> 00:13:28,367
don't tell me Parak did too.

179
00:13:28,500 --> 00:13:29,767
He's all alone!

180
00:13:29,900 --> 00:13:31,133
<i>Looks like he's with someone,
Boss.</i>

181
00:13:31,267 --> 00:13:33,333
<i>Someone's helping him, I even
got locked in the warehouse.</i>

182
00:13:33,467 --> 00:13:35,133
You idiot!

183
00:13:35,267 --> 00:13:37,400
Fine, I'll handle this myself!

184
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:43,000
Here.

185
00:13:44,167 --> 00:13:45,733
Help me.

186
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:48,733
Here.

187
00:13:52,967 --> 00:13:54,333
There.

188
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,300
Come on, hurry up, hurry up!

189
00:14:15,433 --> 00:14:17,400
I'll meet you on the
other side, okay?

190
00:14:17,533 --> 00:14:18,867
Okay.

191
00:14:20,933 --> 00:14:22,667
Okay, Joey, hurry.

192
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:26,967
Okay.

193
00:14:48,733 --> 00:14:50,300
Joey!

194
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:06,833
Godfather!

195
00:15:08,767 --> 00:15:10,433
Godfather!

196
00:15:12,500 --> 00:15:13,633
Godfather!

197
00:15:16,467 --> 00:15:18,067
Let's go.

198
00:15:20,933 --> 00:15:22,400
Hurry up!

199
00:15:22,533 --> 00:15:24,300
Andrew, get your car.

200
00:15:24,433 --> 00:15:25,933
Meet us halfway.

201
00:15:26,067 --> 00:15:27,633
- Are you sure?
- Yes, go! Hurry!

202
00:15:27,767 --> 00:15:29,167
Go on, go get it.

203
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:31,367
We'll handle things here.
We can manage this.

204
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:32,867
Be careful!

205
00:16:18,933 --> 00:16:21,800
Listen, Jpey, no matter
what happens,

206
00:16:21,933 --> 00:16:25,033
don't come out
and don't scream, okay?

207
00:16:25,167 --> 00:16:26,600
Godfather...

208
00:17:51,967 --> 00:17:54,000
My men were telling the truth.

209
00:17:54,133 --> 00:17:56,000
Someone's helping you!

210
00:17:57,433 --> 00:17:59,367
You have people backing you up!

211
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:02,433
Leave.
Leave now.

212
00:18:03,433 --> 00:18:05,400
Leave now.

213
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:12,500
Leave now.

214
00:18:35,233 --> 00:18:36,767
Your companion's good.

215
00:18:36,900 --> 00:18:38,333
Slippery!

216
00:18:54,900 --> 00:18:55,933
Loloy!

217
00:18:56,067 --> 00:18:58,500
Come get me here
at the other lot!

218
00:18:58,633 --> 00:19:00,000
I've got Diego with me!

219
00:19:00,133 --> 00:19:01,133
Okay, Boss.

220
00:19:01,267 --> 00:19:02,633
I'm on my way.

221
00:19:36,933 --> 00:19:39,867
Do you have any identification
on him, Major?

222
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:41,433
Any marks on his face?

223
00:19:41,567 --> 00:19:43,400
Tattoos?

224
00:19:43,533 --> 00:19:45,567
None.

225
00:19:45,700 --> 00:19:47,267
But I'm sure...

226
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,533
the syndicates sent him

227
00:19:48,667 --> 00:19:50,500
to silence me.

228
00:19:50,633 --> 00:19:52,367
The backup unit didn't catch
him,

229
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:54,000
but there's CCTV in the hallway.

230
00:19:54,133 --> 00:19:55,667
I've already requested
the footage.

231
00:19:55,800 --> 00:19:57,233
The penknife he used...

232
00:19:57,367 --> 00:19:59,633
has also been sent
for forensic testing.

233
00:20:01,667 --> 00:20:03,200
Miguel...

234
00:20:03,333 --> 00:20:05,833
the judge refuses to postpone
the hearing.

235
00:20:06,867 --> 00:20:07,733
According to the sheriff,

236
00:20:07,867 --> 00:20:10,467
the incident has been contained.

237
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:12,300
Now...

238
00:20:12,433 --> 00:20:14,633
unless you have a medical
emergency,

239
00:20:14,767 --> 00:20:16,467
the hearing will proceed.

240
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:17,867
I'm fine, Attorney.

241
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:20,133
Let's just get this over with.

242
00:20:30,833 --> 00:20:31,800
What happened?

243
00:20:31,933 --> 00:20:33,200
Where's Diego?

244
00:20:33,333 --> 00:20:36,133
The syndicate got him.

245
00:20:36,300 --> 00:20:37,733
Come on, let's go!

246
00:20:51,733 --> 00:20:54,200
The accused shall be committed
to the provincial jail

247
00:20:54,333 --> 00:20:56,367
effective immediately,
pending trial.

248
00:20:56,500 --> 00:20:58,767
<i>Three people were killed
in the shooting incident.</i>

249
00:20:58,900 --> 00:21:00,333
<i> The homeowner was identified</i>

250
00:21:00,467 --> 00:21:02,567
<i> as Police Major Diego Aglipay.</i>

251
00:21:02,700 --> 00:21:03,700
Hello, Mom?

252
00:21:03,833 --> 00:21:05,533
Have you heard what happened to
Godfather?

253
00:21:05,667 --> 00:21:06,667
I just hope he's safe.

254
00:21:06,800 --> 00:21:08,067
I've seen groups like the one

255
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:09,533
Diego got involved with.

256
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:11,500
They make people disappear.

257
00:21:11,633 --> 00:21:13,767
If you're hiding something,
tell me.

258
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:15,367
I know someone's helping you!

259
00:21:15,500 --> 00:21:16,433
Who are they?

260
00:21:16,567 --> 00:21:18,067
Expose what really happened.

261
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,033
Maybe that's the only thing

262
00:21:19,167 --> 00:21:20,833
that can truly help Dad.

263
00:21:20,967 --> 00:21:22,533
Joey, we don't have
solid evidence.

264
00:21:22,667 --> 00:21:24,533
We didn't get any direct
admission

265
00:21:24,667 --> 00:21:26,633
from Major Aglipay on record.

266
00:21:26,767 --> 00:21:30,300
I can't release an exposé
without that.
